    "title": "DeKalb Schools weighs potential closure of 27 schools - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JIM BASS ,\n6 hours ago DEKALB COUNTY, Ga. — The DeKalb County School District announced the potential closure of 27 schools and the expansion of 11 in its first release of redistricting scenarios. The proposal is not final and may change based on feedback until a final decision is made in late fall. The scenarios were announced during a Student Assignment Project meeting on Feb. 11. The SAP is DeKalb County Schools’ name for its redistricting process. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
